    "article_summary": "The article describes a transition-metal-free, photoredox-catalyzed C-C coupling between 4-alkyl-dihydropyridines (DHPs) and vinylbenziodoxol(on)es (VBX/VBO). This method enables the stereospecific synthesis of functionalized (E)- and (Z)-alkenes and C-vinyl glycosides with complete retention of the alkene configuration, proceeding via a concerted radical coupling mechanism.",
